# GRUB SHIFT: the quota is 30. Reaching it completes the contract, earns the
# Beacon (the first contract) and moves on to contract 2.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 7
expect quota == 30
cheat clear
cheat kills 29
cheat bug 3 2 1 0
cheat use 5 3 2
expect status == 1
wait 150
expect state == 4
expect streak == 1
expect goals == 1
press A
wait 5
expect state == 1
expect contract == 2
